  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pwu9](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pwu9) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on May 03 2025 7km N of Waris. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.1677 longitude 140.9884. It impacted 44097 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
